        "original_id": "e7719579-86f1-590b-a744-dafa772cb128",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chan Yung-jan, Svetlana Kuznetsova\n- Sports: Tennis, Grand Slam finals\n\nFacts:\n- In 2007, Chan Yung-jan finished runner-up in Grand Slam finals at the Australian Open and the US Open.\n- In 2007, Svetlana Kuznetsova appeared in Grand Slam singles and doubles competition as a professional tennis player.\n- Svetlana Kuznetsova was born on 27 June 1985 and is a Russian tennis player.\n- Svetlana Kuznetsova has appeared in four Grand Slam singles finals and won two of them.\n- Svetlana Kuznetsova has also appeared in seven Grand Slam doubles finals and won two of them.\n- In 2015, Chan Yung-jan finished runner-up in the Australian Open Grand Slam final.",
